            <p class="oem-lead-card__sub">SPORTSWEAR MANUFACTURER WITH 20 YEARS OF EXPERIENCE</p>
          </header>
          {%- render 'talon-oem-process-grid' -%}
        </div>
      </section>

      <section
        class="oem-section oem-customization-major"
        id="manufacturing-workflow"
        aria-labelledby="oem-workflow-detail-title"
      >
        <h2 class="oem-section-title" id="oem-workflow-detail-title">OEM / ODM MANUFACTURING WORKFLOW</h2>
        {%- render 'talon-factory-workflow-2026' -%}
      </section>

      {%- render 'talon-oem-customization-capability-grid' -%}
    </div>

    {%- render 'talon-craft-materials-showcase' -%}

    {%- if oem_show_supplementary_sections -%}
      <section class="oem-section" id="why-work-talon">
        <h2 class="oem-section-title">Why Work With Talon</h2>
        <div class="oem-trust">
          <p class="oem-trust__intro">
            Built for serious custom apparel projects, Talon combines factory execution, quality control, and
            export-ready operations to deliver reliable OEM and ODM outcomes.
          </p>
          <div class="oem-trust-grid">
            <article class="oem-trust-card">
              <div class="oem-trust-card__top">
                <h3>OEM Manufacturing</h3>
                <span class="oem-trust-tag">Factory Direct</span>
              </div>
              <p>Production workflows aligned to your specs, from approved sample to stable bulk output.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="oem-trust-card">
              <div class="oem-trust-card__top">
                <h3>ODM / Private Label</h3>
                <span class="oem-trust-tag">Brand Ready</span>
              </div>
              <p>Fast product adaptation with private label execution, trims, and packaging for market launch.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="oem-trust-card">
              <div class="oem-trust-card__top">
                <h3>Bulk Orders</h3>
                <span class="oem-trust-tag">Volume Support</span>
              </div>
              <p>Capacity-based planning for seasonal, repeat, and large-volume sportswear requirements.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="oem-trust-card">
              <div class="oem-trust-card__top">
                <h3>Sampling Service</h3>
                <span class="oem-trust-tag">Fast Sampling</span>
              </div>
              <p>Structured sample development for fit, fabric, print, and branding approvals before production.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="oem-trust-card">
              <div class="oem-trust-card__top">
                <h3>Worldwide Shipping</h3>
                <span class="oem-trust-tag">Global Delivery</span>
              </div>
              <p>Export-ready dispatch with documentation and packaging suited for international B2B supply.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="oem-trust-card">
              <div class="oem-trust-card__top">
                <h3>Factory Production</h3>
                <span class="oem-trust-tag">Quality Control</span>
              </div>
              <p>In-line QC checkpoints and finishing controls to maintain consistency across every batch.</p>
            </article>
          </div>
