              inspection team has carried out many strict inspections and supervision in the selection of raw materials,
              incoming fabrics, craftsmanship, stitching, ironing and packaging.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="oem-process-item">
            <h3>Timely Delivery</h3>
            <p>
              Our production efficiency will be fully completed before the shipping date. And timely delivery after
              receiving the balance payment.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="oem-process-item">
            <h3>After-sales Service</h3>
            <p>
